  "question": {
    "text": "Water coming with velocity <math><mi>v</mi></math> drops onto a mesh through which&nbsp;<math><mn>50</mn><mi>%</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>&nbsp;of the water passes by, <math><mn>25</mn><mi>%</mi></math> loses its entire momentum and <math><mn>25</mn><mi>%</mi></math> bounces back. The pressure on the mesh is"
  },
